# Generated per-edition outputs (decided 2026-11-17): regenerated by
# `services.manual edition` before every deploy, so tracking them only
# produced multi-thousand-line churn diffs that buried real code changes.
# Kept on disk, not in git. Fresh-clone caveat: the web build needs
# data/newsletter.json + data/charts.json present — the edition run
# regenerates both before deploying. data/manual.* (Oct 2 legacy snapshot)
# stays tracked as history.
data/newsletter.json
data/newsletter.md
data/newsletter-email.html
data/raw.json
data/charts.json
data/emails/
web/public/newsletter.json
web/public/charts.json
web/public/charts/
.firebase/
